issue.body:
Hi 
As per the update for mockito 2.2.x it supports mocking a final class, but when i try to mock the URL.class i get the values of the object null in the debug mode. I am using mockito-core-2.2.16 with java 7. I am not sure what is wrong with my code.

               URL u = mock(URL.class);
	        HttpsURLConnection huc = mock(HttpsURLConnection.class);
	        when(new URL(anyString())).thenReturn(u);
	        when(u.openConnection()).thenReturn(huc);

Thanks
Shreyas
